WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:06.313
Lab 2 runs the gate in your own test tenant,
worldwide or G C C, never production.

2
00:00:06.313 --> 00:00:08.637
Set up a contractor provisioning app.

3
00:00:08.637 --> 00:00:12.256
Send two test contractors through
the middleware's apply path,

4
00:00:12.256 --> 00:00:14.275
then reconcile against the tenant.

5
00:00:14.275 --> 00:00:17.742
And apply the review settings
to a test contractor package;

6
00:00:17.742 --> 00:00:21.775
the chapter names the cmdlet and
permission for updating the policy.

7
00:00:21.775 --> 00:00:25.782
The middleware's identity holds
one permission, the synchronization

8
00:00:25.782 --> 00:00:29.650
upload permission, scoped to the
contractor provisioning app only.

9
00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:34.588
The reader app holds User dot Read dot
All and the lifecycle information read.

10
00:00:34.588 --> 00:00:39.416
To back it out, restore the policy's previous
review settings from your read-back,

11
00:00:39.416 --> 00:00:44.173
pause the provisioning job, which keeps
its state, delete the test contractors,

12
00:00:44.173 --> 00:00:48.124
remove the permissions, and delete
the export and output folders.

13
00:00:48.124 --> 00:00:50.330
The authors haven't run Lab 2.
